丽、西击乌桓，威行海外，吸引管宁、邴原等名士避乱。","en":"Originating from the Ji clan, the Gongsun clan was a prominent Family of You Province. Gongsun Du's father, Gongsun Yan, fled turmoil to settle in Xuantu, subsequently becoming a powerful magnate of Liaodong. For three generations, they held independent sway over Liaodong for fifty years, launching expeditions East against Goguryeo and West against the Wuhuan, extending their might beyond the seas and attracting renowned scholars like Guan Ning and Bing Yuan to seek refuge."},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"2","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1006","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[72,66,65,58,56,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"4500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1006","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[72,66,65,58,56,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"4500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1006","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,66,65,58,56,62],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"120","reputation":"4550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190","month